# Every pull request requests a review from the owner listed here. On its own
# this only REQUESTS a review -- it does not block a merge. Pair it with
# branch protection on `main` ("Require a pull request before merging" plus
# "Require review from Code Owners") for that, which a public repository gets
# for free.
#
# Without that pairing, a dependency bot can merge a breaking major change
# with nobody having read it, which is what happened here once already.
